    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Find the exact value of $\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta$, given that $\\tan\\theta=\\frac{5}{12}$ and $\\theta\\in(180^{\\circ},270^{\\circ})$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$-\\frac{13}{5}$",
      "worked": "The reference triangle has opposite side $5$ and adjacent side $12$. By Pythagoras,\n$$\\begin{align*}h&=\\sqrt{5^2+12^2}\\\\h&=13\\end{align*}$$\nSine is negative in quadrant III.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin\\theta&=-\\frac{5}{13}\\\\\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta&=\\frac{1}{-5/13}\\\\\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta&=-\\frac{13}{5}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 62
  },
